  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math> is defined on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>]</mo></math> as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>min</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>[</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>]</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>]</mo></math> denotes the greatest integer <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi></math>. The number of points, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math> is not differentiable in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is ___ .</p>",
